[gd_scene load_steps=13 format=3]

; The variable is the drawing of each Shape2D class under Visible Collision Shapes: a filled and outlined
; rectangle, circle, capsule and convex polygon, the stroked concave soup, segment, world boundary and
; separation ray, then a rotated node, a disabled shape, one-way arrows and a debug_color. No other golden
; turns the toggle on for a 2D shape, so none shows a regression in it. Measure with
; `pnpm ref:diff unit-collision-shapes-2d.tscn --collisions`; the golden captures with the same toggle.

